     "voice": "en-US-BrianNeural",
     "rate": "+0%",
     "text": "Ten thousand bitcoins once bought two pizzas. Most think bitcoin appeared as a massive global currency overnight, but it started as a simple white paper in two thousand eight by a creator using the pseudonym Satoshi Nakamoto during the devastating global financial crisis so the bitcoin network launched on January third, two thousand nine, when Satoshi Nakamoto mined the genesis block. For months it had no real commercial value at all, until May twenty-second, two thousand ten, when someone famously exchanged ten thousand bitcoins for two Papa John's pizzas worth forty-one dollars back then. Ten thousand bitcoins bought dinner, and a trillion-dollar industry was born."
    }
